'''Peculiar Plaza''' (Japanese: '''ふしぎな広場''' ''Mysterious Plaza'') is a {{TCGP|Stadium card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Stadium
|rule=SV Stadium
|effect=The Retreat Cost of each {{e|Psychic}} Pokémon in play ''(both yours and your opponent's)'' is 2 less.
}}

==Trivia==
*This card's effect is the same as that of the {{TCG|Phoebe's Stadium}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
